# =============================================================================
# MR5 School — Monorepo environment index (enterprise)
# =============================================================================
# Only template files are tracked — copy to .env (never commit .env)
#
#   Mr5-School-API-main/.env.example            → Mr5-School-API-main/.env
#   Mr5-School-API-main/.env.local.example      → Mr5-School-API-main/.env (dev)
#   Mr5-School-API-main/.env.production.example → AWS Secrets Manager (API)
#
#   client-main/.env.example                    → client-main/.env
#   client-main/.env.local.example              → client-main/.env.local (dev)
#   client-main/.env.production.example         → AWS Secrets Manager (web)
#
#   .env.production.example                     → Docker Compose root secrets
#
# Dev ports: API 5001 (macOS) / Web 3000
# Prod/Docker ports: API 5000 / Web 3000
# Production secrets: AWS Secrets Manager — docs/AWS_SECRETS_MIGRATION.md
# =============================================================================
